He went out of town
the last Friday in march.


00:57:54.572 --> 00:57:55.971
Where did he go?


00:57:55.973 --> 00:57:58.807
His mother tried to kill herself


00:57:58.809 --> 00:58:01.743
in some kind of institution in Phoenix.


00:58:01.745 --> 00:58:04.213
Earl went down there to see her.


00:58:04.215 --> 00:58:06.248
Do you know the name
of the place?


00:58:10.087 --> 00:58:11.987
Sunnybrook.


00:58:13.123 --> 00:58:15.524
Like the farm.


00:58:15.526 --> 00:58:19.661
Good evening.
Sunnybrook.


00:58:19.663 --> 00:58:24.233
Hi. I'm the daughter of a patient there,
a Mrs. parkins.


00:58:24.235 --> 00:58:26.702
My brother's missing,
and I'm trying to locate him.


00:58:26.704 --> 00:58:29.905
Can you tell me whether he visited her
on march 29th?


00:58:29.907 --> 00:58:32.808
I'm sorry. We do not
keep detailed records.


00:58:32.810 --> 00:58:35.844
All I can tell you is whether or not she had
any visitors that day.


00:58:35.846 --> 00:58:38.013
Well, could you please do that?


00:58:38.015 --> 00:58:39.781
Let's see.


00:58:39.783 --> 00:58:42.584
Mrs. may parkins.


00:58:42.586 --> 00:58:45.587
All right, had one male visitor
on the 29th.


00:58:45.589 --> 00:58:48.156
He arrived at 7:00 P.M.
and left at 9:00.


00:58:48.158 --> 00:58:50.158
He came back the next day at noon.


00:58:50.160 --> 00:58:51.760
Are you sure?


00:58:51.762 --> 00:58:54.696
Absolutely. I recorded it myself.


00:59:01.005 --> 00:59:03.105
What are you doing?


00:59:05.209 --> 00:59:07.109
Baiting a trap.


00:59:19.957 --> 00:59:21.723
Hi there. This is Tony.


00:59:21.725 --> 00:59:23.125
I'm not here right now.


00:59:23.127 --> 00:59:24.626
Leave a message at the beep,


00:59:24.628 --> 00:59:26.028
and I'll call you back.


00:59:27.631 --> 00:59:29.031
Hi. It's me.


00:59:29.033 --> 00:59:31.300
Meet me at the mini mart at 9:00.


00:59:31.302 --> 00:59:33.235
I need to talk to you.


00:59:37.641 --> 00:59:39.741
Hi.


00:59:39.743 --> 00:59:41.243
Look, we got to make this fast.


00:59:41.245 --> 00:59:43.612
I got to get back to Earl the pearl.


00:59:43.614 --> 00:59:44.980
Earl didn't do it.


00:59:46.216 --> 00:59:47.783
What do you mean?


00:59:47.785 --> 00:59:51.753
I thought you said
you didn't have a car.


00:59:51.755 --> 00:59:53.355
I don't.


00:59:53.357 --> 00:59:57.125
Then why is there a blue Malibu parked
in your garage?


00:59:57.127 --> 00:59:59.595
What?


00:59:59.597 --> 01:00:04.166
There's a blue Malibu
parked in your garage.


01:00:08.138 --> 01:00:10.606
It must be my landlord's.


01:00:12.376 --> 01:00:14.242
Does that have anything
to do with the bleach...


01:00:14.244 --> 01:00:15.844
you killed her.


01:00:17.848 --> 01:00:20.182
Shit. For a second,
I thought...


01:00:32.296 --> 01:00:34.262
Excuse me.


01:00:34.264 --> 01:00:35.998
I have to go murder someone.


01:01:12.269 --> 01:01:14.102
Tony: Mary.


01:01:49.940 --> 01:01:51.006
Unh!


01:01:52.976 --> 01:01:55.143
Mary, Mary.


01:02:32.049 --> 01:02:33.815
-  Row number three...


01:02:33.817 --> 01:02:35.183
- Mary, you okay?
-  Will stand up.


01:02:35.185 --> 01:02:36.518
It's just a dream.


01:02:36.520 --> 01:02:38.121
- Just breathe slow.


01:02:38.122 --> 01:02:40.088
Are you all right?


01:02:41.825 --> 01:02:45.060
Take her out of the sun.
Get her some water.


01:02:50.334 --> 01:02:52.367
What the hell is going on?


01:02:52.369 --> 01:02:53.869
You don't return my calls.


01:02:53.871 --> 01:02:55.937
Please stay with me tonight.


01:02:55.939 --> 01:02:58.073
It's the exchange dance.


01:02:58.075 --> 01:03:00.041
Please.


01:03:00.043 --> 01:03:02.110
Come with me.


01:03:11.121 --> 01:03:13.822
That info on the Malibu plates came in.


01:03:22.933 --> 01:03:25.934
Is there a girl with...


01:03:25.936 --> 01:03:28.336
Blonde hair that lives here?


01:03:29.406 --> 01:03:31.006
She's not here right now.


01:03:32.576 --> 01:03:34.176
I need to talk to her.


01:03:34.178 --> 01:03:35.911
Um...


01:03:35.913 --> 01:03:38.980
Something's happening, and I...


01:03:45.956 --> 01:03:48.123
I want you to watch your sister.


01:04:02.039 --> 01:04:03.438
What's going on?


01:04:03.440 --> 01:04:05.207
I don't know.
I mean, some weird girl


01:04:05.209 --> 01:04:06.608
stops by the house today, right,


01:04:06.610 --> 01:04:08.143
totally freaks out my mom.


01:04:08.145 --> 01:04:09.945
Who was it?


01:04:09.947 --> 01:04:11.880
She had, like, this gigantic bruise
over her arm.


01:04:11.882 --> 01:04:13.915
It looked like somebody kicked
the shit out of her.


01:04:13.917 --> 01:04:14.983
What?


01:04:17.454 --> 01:04:20.055
Some weird girl
stopped by the house today.


01:04:20.057 --> 01:04:22.490
It looked like she was
on something, you know?


01:04:22.492 --> 01:04:23.992
What did she say?


01:04:23.994 --> 01:04:25.393
Nothing.
She just said


01:04:25.395 --> 01:04:27.996
she wanted to talk to you.


01:04:27.998 --> 01:04:30.365
I'll be right back.
I got to go see her.


01:04:32.603 --> 01:04:34.202
You see?


01:04:34.204 --> 01:04:36.872
She's acting
like a total psycho.


01:04:58.629 --> 01:05:00.295
Why didn't you
answer your phone?


01:05:08.906 --> 01:05:10.272
Damn it.


01:05:38.201 --> 01:05:40.335
No way am I going up on that thing.


01:06:12.436 --> 01:06:14.102
Oh, my God.


01:06:48.205 --> 01:06:51.506
Oh, my God.


01:06:51.508 --> 01:06:53.575
No!


01:06:53.577 --> 01:06:54.676
No!


01:06:54.678 --> 01:06:55.744
Stop it!


01:07:20.504 --> 01:07:22.037
Are you okay?


01:07:23.273 --> 01:07:25.440
Mary.


01:07:25.442 --> 01:07:28.243
I'm sorry I hit you.


01:07:28.245 --> 01:07:30.345
I thought you were going
to take us both down.


01:07:33.050 --> 01:07:36.151
I'm not going
to hurt you, Mary.


01:07:36.153 --> 01:07:38.520
I was scared to death up there.


01:07:43.293 --> 01:07:45.794
Why was today circled
on your calendar?


01:07:45.796 --> 01:07:49.631
I had my final exams
this morning.


01:07:49.633 --> 01:07:51.766
I passed.
I'm a cop.


01:07:51.768 --> 01:07:54.469
Overheard Earl and that woman Roxanne


01:07:54.471 --> 01:07:56.071
talking about you.


01:07:56.073 --> 01:07:57.138
I got worried.


01:07:57.140 --> 01:07:58.339
I borrowed my landlord's car


01:07:58.341 --> 01:07:59.808
to make sure you were okay.


01:08:09.286 --> 01:08:10.685
Here.


01:08:10.687 --> 01:08:12.387
You dropped these.


01:08:24.101 --> 01:08:25.500
Come with me.


01:08:25.502 --> 01:08:27.102
I don't want to leave you here.


01:08:27.104 --> 01:08:29.637
Where are you going?


01:08:29.639 --> 01:08:32.474
Sherry tarnley's
been reported missing.


01:08:34.845 --> 01:08:36.678
Hey, hey, what's going on?


01:08:36.680 --> 01:08:38.680
We found the decomposed
girl's jacket.


01:08:38.682 --> 01:08:40.815
Forensics looked at a print
off one of the buttons,


01:08:40.817 --> 01:08:42.884
and they matched to a guy who works
at the carnival.


01:08:42.886 --> 01:08:44.452
Who?


01:08:44.454 --> 01:08:47.522
An ex-con named Earl parkins.


01:09:29.299 --> 01:09:30.798
Sherry.


01:09:30.800 --> 01:09:32.800
Oh, my God.


01:09:32.802 --> 01:09:34.402
- Shh, shh, shh.


01:09:34.404 --> 01:09:35.870
Quiet. Quiet.


01:10:13.343 --> 01:10:15.677
Hey, want me to bag the noose?


01:10:15.679 --> 01:10:18.947
Nah. It's a slam-dunk suicide.


01:10:20.584 --> 01:10:22.584
It's all my fault.


01:10:22.586 --> 01:10:25.653
Why didn't you tell me about parkins?


01:10:28.325 --> 01:10:29.791
Keep the tape up.


01:10:30.760 --> 01:10:32.560
Get the lab here.


01:10:32.562 --> 01:10:34.362
I want you in my office


01:10:34.364 --> 01:10:35.897
at 8:00 A.M.


01:10:35.899 --> 01:10:36.998
Yes, sir.


01:10:37.000 --> 01:10:39.634
Looks like the guy
left us a note.


01:10:41.438 --> 01:10:43.438
We got to run this stuff back down.


01:10:44.941 --> 01:10:46.541
These young women


01:10:46.543 --> 01:10:48.810
will now step into the world...


01:10:50.380 --> 01:10:52.747
And take with them an education


01:10:52.749 --> 01:10:54.882
that will serve them well.


01:10:56.553 --> 01:11:00.488
Girls, you've only
just begun your journey.


01:11:02.459 --> 01:11:04.626
May your lives be filled with love,


01:11:04.628 --> 01:11:08.429
charity, hope, and happiness.


01:11:14.904 --> 01:11:16.771
We're so proud of you.


01:11:30.453 --> 01:11:32.320
Well, we wouldn't
miss this for the world.


01:11:32.322 --> 01:11:33.688
Not for the world.


01:11:35.659 --> 01:11:37.392
Excuse me.


01:11:37.394 --> 01:11:39.661
Party! Party!


01:11:39.663 --> 01:11:42.730
Party! Party! Party!


01:11:50.473 --> 01:11:51.939
Hi.


01:11:55.845 --> 01:11:57.445
Hi.


01:11:57.447 --> 01:11:59.714
Congratulations.


01:12:03.453 --> 01:12:05.486
Sherry came to me.


01:12:20.403 --> 01:12:25.473
Chevy Malibu registered
to Daniel Henry moffat.


01:12:27.610 --> 01:12:29.977
Sir, we're going to order
out for some Chinese.


01:12:29.979 --> 01:12:31.579
Do you want some?


01:12:31.581 --> 01:12:32.947
Jesus.


01:12:32.949 --> 01:12:35.616
How many people did you
interrogate today?


01:12:35.618 --> 01:12:37.785
Parkins was in the joint
for forgery.


01:12:37.787 --> 01:12:39.487
He never hurt a flea.


01:12:39.489 --> 01:12:41.989
Now all of a sudden, he confesses
to six murders?


01:12:41.991 --> 01:12:44.025
Yeah, well,
the note contains details


01:12:44.027 --> 01:12:45.626
only the killer could know.


01:12:45.628 --> 01:12:47.995
The guy wasn't a whacko.


01:12:47.997 --> 01:12:50.098
All his jail
psych tests were normal.


01:12:51.601 --> 01:12:54.135
He's a guy with
no reason to kill.


01:13:12.822 --> 01:13:14.622
Get this dusted for me.


01:13:27.504 --> 01:13:29.871
I'm sorry to bother you,
Mr. tarnley,


01:13:29.873 --> 01:13:32.874
but I need to ask you
one more question.


01:13:32.876 --> 01:13:35.176
To your knowledge, did parkins
have any female friends


01:13:35.178 --> 01:13:36.878
other than your daughter?


01:13:38.615 --> 01:13:40.681
Did Sherry ever mention anyone?


01:13:40.683 --> 01:13:44.752
She mentioned an ex-wife
a couple of times,


01:13:44.754 --> 01:13:48.956
said she was real jealous.
"Jealous," I said.


01:13:48.958 --> 01:13:51.659
"Now, that's what you get
for fornicating against the lord."


01:13:51.661 --> 01:13:53.561
- You throw down his commandment...
- Please.


01:13:55.165 --> 01:13:57.799
This ex-wife, do you remember
the woman's name?


01:13:59.969 --> 01:14:01.669
Roxanne.


01:14:01.671 --> 01:14:03.137
Roxanne something.


01:14:43.179 --> 01:14:45.046
This is one-Stanley-seven.


01:14:45.048 --> 01:14:47.648
I need to get an a.P.B.
On the teletype right away.


01:14:47.650 --> 01:14:49.183
Roxanne dicarlo...


01:14:49.185 --> 01:14:51.853
Caucasian, 35,


01:14:51.855 --> 01:14:54.155
may be dangerous.


01:15:23.086 --> 01:15:25.786
Have a nice ride.


01:15:25.788 --> 01:15:27.889
Earl loves me.


01:15:27.891 --> 01:15:30.024
Looks like the guy left us a note.


01:15:31.027 --> 01:15:32.627
Suicide.


01:15:53.049 --> 01:15:54.715
The noose.


01:16:14.737 --> 01:16:17.104
There's no way
he could do this with one hand.


01:18:00.777 --> 01:18:02.710
You like my photos?


01:18:04.247 --> 01:18:06.414
Hmm?


01:18:06.416 --> 01:18:08.816
I was working that night.


01:18:08.818 --> 01:18:11.218
A person can get upset.


01:18:11.220 --> 01:18:14.221
Hey, we got that print info back
on the styrofoam cup.


01:18:17.126 --> 01:18:18.859
What is it?


01:18:20.029 --> 01:18:21.796
Jesus Christ.


01:18:22.999 --> 01:18:25.099
Aren't you going
to ask any questions?


01:18:25.101 --> 01:18:28.169
Cops are supposed
to ask questions.


01:18:29.872 --> 01:18:31.906
Earl and I go way back.


01:18:31.908 --> 01:18:34.275
I did him a favor once.


01:18:34.277 --> 01:18:36.410
When he got out,
he let me borrow his cars.


01:18:36.412 --> 01:18:38.145
Nice guy.


01:18:38.147 --> 01:18:41.115
Till he fell in love
with Sherry.


01:18:41.117 --> 01:18:42.783
Then he got the idea


01:18:42.785 --> 01:18:45.786
the world was a beautiful place.


01:18:45.788 --> 01:18:47.722
I had to teach him a lesson.


01:18:49.492 --> 01:18:52.426
It was so easy to set it all up.


01:18:56.966 --> 01:18:59.300
You know, I followed you that day,


01:18:59.302 --> 01:19:01.168
from the station to the pool,


01:19:01.170 --> 01:19:02.903
don't you, Mary?


01:19:02.905 --> 01:19:05.740
I watched you at night,


01:19:05.742 --> 01:19:07.842
looked through your window,


01:19:07.844 --> 01:19:10.277
saw you touching my picture.


01:19:13.082 --> 01:19:16.083
The moment I saw you,


01:19:16.085 --> 01:19:19.520
marching around in that little uniform...


01:19:21.491 --> 01:19:23.924
So sure of the world...


01:19:26.028 --> 01:19:28.996
just knew I had to be
your teacher too.


01:19:36.773 --> 01:19:39.907
You planted the rabbit's foot
at Kathleen's...


01:19:41.511 --> 01:19:44.411
The prints that implicated parkins...


01:19:47.450 --> 01:19:49.550
The suicide note.


01:19:49.552 --> 01:19:52.887
It's time to open
your graduation present.


01:20:13.843 --> 01:20:16.177
Did she say where she was going?


01:20:16.179 --> 01:20:18.179
- No.
- Did she say anything?


01:20:18.181 --> 01:20:20.481
After the graduation,


01:20:20.483 --> 01:20:23.484
she kept asking me
why this girl Sherry


01:20:23.486 --> 01:20:26.220
would go to a recycling
place alone


01:20:26.222 --> 01:20:28.556
with someone who
she knew was dangerous.


01:20:34.864 --> 01:20:36.363
Kathleen?


01:20:38.134 --> 01:20:41.435
She was the easiest one of all.


01:20:43.472 --> 01:20:45.306
Hi.


01:20:45.308 --> 01:20:47.374
I told her I was a police officer.


01:20:47.376 --> 01:20:48.976
I needed her to check out


01:20:48.978 --> 01:20:50.611
some illegal activity
over at the mini mart.


01:20:50.613 --> 01:20:53.581
Good. It's a good job,
very serious job.


01:20:53.583 --> 01:20:55.249
Apparently the clerk there


01:20:55.251 --> 01:20:57.418
had been selling drugs
to junior high school kids


01:20:57.420 --> 01:21:00.421
who brought cleaning supplies
to the counter.


01:21:00.423 --> 01:21:03.057
Could she go in, purchase some,


01:21:03.059 --> 01:21:05.326
see if he approached her?


01:21:05.328 --> 01:21:08.863
She was such a good little citizen.


01:21:25.448 --> 01:21:27.381
No. He didn't try
to sell me anything.


01:22:01.450 --> 01:22:03.050
Don't get up.


01:22:03.052 --> 01:22:04.618
You don't want to get up.


01:22:12.395 --> 01:22:14.194
Bang.


01:22:14.196 --> 01:22:16.096
Hold it right there, Campbell.


01:22:17.066 --> 01:22:20.134
Put your hands up slowly.


01:22:21.570 --> 01:22:25.572
Well, if isn't papa cop...


01:22:25.574 --> 01:22:28.142
Come to save little baby cop.


01:22:28.144 --> 01:22:29.376
Shut up.


01:22:31.714 --> 01:22:34.114
You know, after we had
our little talk,


01:22:34.116 --> 01:22:36.183
I got to wondering
who the hell you were,


01:22:36.185 --> 01:22:38.085
so I lifted your prints


01:22:38.087 --> 01:22:40.120
off the coffee cup you left in my office.


01:22:40.122 --> 01:22:44.124
Then I got a match
from the f.B.I.


01:22:44.126 --> 01:22:46.493
Daniel Henry moffat.


01:22:46.495 --> 01:22:48.329
Roomed with Earl parkins


01:22:48.331 --> 01:22:50.564
in the Utah state penitentiary.


01:22:52.001 --> 01:22:53.534
Whose prints did you use


01:22:53.536 --> 01:22:56.203
for your cadet exam, moffat?


01:22:56.205 --> 01:22:59.039
The girl we found up on skyline?


01:23:01.243 --> 01:23:03.377
Get on the floor.


01:23:03.379 --> 01:23:05.112
Get on the floor!


01:23:14.056 --> 01:23:15.522
Put your hands
behind your back.


01:23:20.262 --> 01:23:21.395
Ohh!


01:23:21.397 --> 01:23:22.696
No!


01:23:45.287 --> 01:23:47.021
Ohh!


01:23:56.065 --> 01:23:57.431
Ohh!


01:24:03.339 --> 01:24:05.406
Aah! Aah!


01:24:51.554 --> 01:24:53.253
Why?


01:24:56.358 --> 01:24:58.325
Why?


01:25:00.496 --> 01:25:02.162
Why?


01:25:04.700 --> 01:25:07.134
No reason, Mary.


01:25:07.136 --> 01:25:09.169
That's the real world.


01:26:04.927 --> 01:26:07.361
Ohh!


01:26:12.902 --> 01:26:14.535
Oh, my God.


01:26:21.577 --> 01:26:23.744
Mary.


01:26:28.551 --> 01:26:29.917
Mary.


01:26:29.919 --> 01:26:31.585
Can you reach?


01:26:42.331 --> 01:26:44.498
No.


01:26:44.500 --> 01:26:46.567
No.
